            <ArticleTitle>Symptomatic disc herniation into the vertebral body.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>621-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic disc herniations into the vertebral body are a common finding and rarely produce symptoms. However, trauma may cause them to become symptomatic and to imitate other mass lesions.</AbstractText>
